# E-Tongue for Dravya Detection

An electronic tongue (E-Tongue) system that classifies Ayurvedic liquid
samples using sensor data and machine learning.

## What it does
- Measures pH, Total Dissolved Solids (TDS) and Electrical Conductivity (EC)
- Sends readings from an Arduino-based setup to a computer
- Classifies samples such as Aloe vera, Amla and Giloy with trained ML models
- Shows results in a Flask-based web interface

